      <p class="_abstract">You can use the control plane machine set to improve the resiliency of the control plane for your OpenShift Container Platform cluster.</p>
      <h2 id="cpmso-failure-domains_cpmso-resiliency" class="group scroll-mt-20">High availability and fault tolerance with failure domains<a href="#cpmso-failure-domains_cpmso-resiliency" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
